WEBVTT

00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:11.342
Unos, dos, tres, catorce

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:19.060
Turn it up loud, captain

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:25.672
Lights go down, it's dark

00:00:25.672 --> 00:00:29.100
The jungle is your head,
can't rule your heart

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.190
A feeling's so much
stronger than a thought

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.211
Your eyes are wide
and though your soul

00:00:34.211 --> 00:00:35.607
It can't be bought

00:00:35.607 --> 00:00:37.411
Your mind can wander

00:00:37.411 --> 00:00:40.754
Hello, hello (hola)

00:00:40.754 --> 00:00:44.219
I'm at a place called
Vertigo (¿dónde está?)

00:00:44.219 --> 00:00:46.701
It's everything I wish I didn't know

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:50.120
Except you give me something

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:54.010
I can feel

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.760
Feel

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.940
The night is full of holes

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:03.440
'Cause bullets rip the
sky of ink with gold

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.799
They twinkle as the
boys play rock and roll

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:10.270
They know that they can't
dance, at least they know

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.669
I can't stand the beat,
I'm asking for the check

00:01:13.669 --> 00:01:17.179
Girl with crimson nails
has Jesus around her neck

00:01:17.179 --> 00:01:20.704
Swinging to the music, swinging
to the music (whoa, whoa)

00:01:20.704 --> 00:01:25.437
(Whoa, whoa, whoa)

00:01:25.437 --> 00:01:28.637
Hello, hello (hola)

00:01:28.637 --> 00:01:32.175
I'm at a place called
Vertigo (¿dónde está?)

00:01:32.175 --> 00:01:34.696
It's everything I wish I didn't know

00:01:34.696 --> 00:01:38.468
But you give me something

00:01:38.468 --> 00:01:42.073
I can feel

00:01:42.073 --> 00:01:47.073
Feel

00:01:48.063 --> 00:01:51.032
Checkmated

00:01:51.032 --> 00:01:54.089
Just fun

00:01:54.089 --> 00:01:57.339
She made it in, yeah

00:02:09.972 --> 00:02:13.690
All of this, all of this can be yours

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.790
All of this, all of this can be yours

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:20.000
All of this, all of this can be yours

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.519
Just give me what I want
and no one gets hurt

00:02:24.519 --> 00:02:27.410
Hello, hello (hola)

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:31.021
We're at a place called
Vertigo (¿dónde está?)

00:02:31.021 --> 00:02:33.281
Lights go down, and all I know

00:02:33.281 --> 00:02:36.983
Is that you give me something

00:02:36.983 --> 00:02:41.983
I can feel your love teaching me how

00:02:44.639 --> 00:02:49.639
Your love is teaching me how

00:02:50.749 --> 00:02:54.720
How to kneel

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.590
Kneel

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:02.034
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,
yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah

00:03:02.034 --> 00:03:07.034
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,
yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah
